 "lines": {"trout_dip_the_net_reed_for_leaves": ["Leaves out. Trout rose to check my work, then left a review of ripples.", "Scooped the soggy ones first. Trout hate soggy."], "trout_look_the_spots_over_for_pale_patches": ["Spots all accounted for. I counted twice, at the rim of shame.", "No pale patches. Healthier than my last three weeks."], "trout_sprinkle_flakes_a_pinch_at_a_time": ["Pinch, rise. Pinch, rise. It is bossing me about.", "A flake at a time. Dinner as a dance with a leash."], "trout_let_a_crumb_slide_off_the_bill": ["Took it and a bit of my nerve.", "Crumb accepted. Dignity declined."], "trout_balance_a_twig_on_the_water_to_lead": ["Followed the twig the whole way. Faithful to anything that floats.", "A twig, a trout, a tiny parade."], "trout_sprint_the_shelf_with_the_flurry": ["Lost by six rings. It rises faster than I can sprint.", "Raced a trout. Beat it on the way back. It was not racing."], "trout_hold_dead_still_for_the_first_rise": ["Still enough that a dragonfly would have applied for the job.", "Trust takes a motionless duck. I have a talent."], "trout_bow_to_the_spotted_riser": ["Bowed to a riser. It rose to my forehead.", "Respect shown. Ripples returned."], "trout_argue_the_freckle_count": ["It insists on twenty-one. It has the spots, I have the arithmetic.", "Lost the count and the argument. Two for two."], "trout_cheer_the_flurry_from_the_bank": ["Seven rises, no encore. A tough crowd, the water.", "Cheered till my bill hurt. Trout carried on regardless."], "trout_flinch_from_the_rise_at_his_bill": ["Smacked the bill like a cymbal. Rude, quick, correct.", "I was a crumb for half a second. Humbling."], "trout_hold_still_together_for_the_rise": ["Two ducks holding their breath. The fish is the only one breathing.", "Silent as a pair of garden gnomes. It came up for us."], "trout_read_the_rings_aloud_to_a_friend": ["We agreed on nothing. Excellent teamwork.", "Two readers, one ripple. The fish wrote the book."]},
